gBG(){return"A day in the Week list"},
gBF(){return"The icon and word come from the provider's weather type for each hour between 06:00 and 22:00, averaged: clear counts most, then mainly clear, partly cloudy, and cloudy least. A day where almost every hour is partly cloudy reads as partly cloudy, even if there are hours of sun in it, and one passing cloud does not turn a clear day cloudy. Rain or snow only decides the day when there are at least three wet hours in that time, or 3 mm in total, so one shower does not make a rainy day. Sunshine hours are shown separately."},
